Gone Nutty is a animation, adventure, comedy film directed by Carlos Saldanha.

2
00:00:54,545 --> 00:01:00,545
Scrat tries to finish his rather large collection of
acorns when things start going nutty.

3
00:01:21,818 --> 00:01:27,818
Scrat (voice), played by Chris Wedge.

4
00:01:49,090 --> 00:01:55,090
Gone Nutty (also known as Scrat's Missing Adventure) is a 2002 American
animated short film directed by Carlos Saldanha for Blue Sky Studios.

5
00:02:16,363 --> 00:02:22,363
The short features the character Scrat from Ice Age, who is yet again
having troubles with collecting his beloved acorn.

6
00:02:43,636 --> 00:02:49,636
It was debuted on November 26, 2002 on the Ice Age DVD and VHS.

7
00:03:10,909 --> 00:03:16,909
This film was shown in theaters with Garfield: The Movie in 2004.

8
00:03:38,181 --> 00:03:44,181
The film was nominated for the 2003 Academy Award for Best Animated Short Film.

9
00:04:05,454 --> 00:04:11,454
The film explores themes of squirrel, ice age, short film, acorn, absurd.

10
00:04:32,727 --> 00:04:38,727
The tone is lighthearted.
